  summary: Requires protected action ballots to be held at the same time.;
  executionSurface: modalities::logic::deontic;
  curationStatus: Proposed;
  @condition: (a) that the level of disruption of the employer’s enterprise, or at the workplace, could be reduced if the ballots were held at the same time;;
